      "definitionOfDone": [
        "Chat activity Trajectory and Workspace Run expose store-level bounded pages with opaque source-bound cursors and honest complete partial unavailable or incompatible cuts across supported backends",
        "typed adapters preserve each owning store status revision durability requiredness sensitivity and authority precedence while causal lineage joins identities without copying business payloads",
        "per-scope materialization serializes atomic snapshots and bounded delta replay with generation rotation gap reset source drift backpressure and protected gate attempt coverage error and terminal retention",
        "opaque source cursors are never lexicographically ordered requiredness and coverage cannot improve within one generation and recovered coverage rotates generation",
        "main-process evidence resolution binds target to server-issued projection anchors reauthorizes every page and returns only bounded allowlisted redacted typed outcomes without exposing raw reasoning file content tool arguments paths grants or cached permission",
        "shadow parity records zero missing required facts lifecycle mismatches sensitive leaks and duplicate stable ids while every optional difference has a bounded reason and source-cut witness",
        "historical CD03 closure fixtures normalize every downstream workstream and Feature checkpoint before generating review evidence so future active work cannot contaminate predecessor tests",
        "a reproducible machine-readable baseline freezes absolute projection CPU retained heap snapshot and ring bytes publication latency reset-rate and current legacy DOM controls before any renderer cutover",
        "focused backend replay security and parity tests test type coverage full verify production smoke continuation program harness whitespace and independent parity review pass with no renderer cutover"
      ],
